  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 401.02 State plumbing code",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 401.02 \"State plumbing code\" means that part of the state building code, as defined in RSA 155-A:1, IV, which regulates plumbing, as modified by the state building code review board within the limits established by RSA 155-A:10, V.\n\nSource. #10848, eff 7-1-15",
